PHASE 1: Discovery and Analysis
---

DISCOVERY COMPLETE - $(date -u +"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S UTC")
---

Current Architecture (As-Built):
1. apps/app/app/api/chat/route.ts calls RubicAI provider
2. RubicAI provider (packages/ai/lib/rubic-provider.ts) hits AGENT_SERVICE_URL (/v1/complete)
3. Agent service (services/agent/src/routes/completion.py) handles tool loop directly
4. Agent uses direct E2B SDK (not sandbox microservice)
5. SSE proxy (apps/app/lib/chat/agent-proxy.ts) transforms events

New Orchestrator Service:
- services/orchestrator/src/index.ts - Fastify app on port 4014
- services/orchestrator/src/routes/sessions.ts - /v1/sessions endpoints
- Uses runAgentLoop from lib/agent-loop.js
- In-memory session storage (Map)

KEY GAP: Frontend still routes to legacy AGENT_SERVICE_URL (port 8000), not orchestrator (port 4014)

Migration Tasks Required:
A) Update RubicAI provider to use orchestrator endpoints
B) Update chat route to use new orchestrator session flow
C) Wire sandbox service for tool execution (not direct E2B in agent)
D) Ensure SSE event transformation matches new event schema
E) Test end-to-end with browser/terminal streaming

